  "accountTypes": [
    {
      "name": "CounterState",
      "pda": "counter",
      "docs": [
        "On-chain counter state.",
        "",
        "The `#[account]` macro generates:",
        "- A discriminator field (`CounterAccountType::CounterState`) as the first",
        "byte.",
        "- A `CounterStateZc` storage view generated by `pinapod::PinaPod`.",
        "- `HasDiscriminator` linking this struct to",
        "`CounterAccountType::CounterState`.",
        "- `initialize` and `try_from_bytes` helpers for caller-owned storage.",
        "",
        "Layout (11 bytes total):",
        "```text",
        "| offset | size | field                     |",
        "|--------|------|---------------------------|",
        "| 0      | 1    | discriminator             |",
        "| 1      | 1    | migration version byte    |",
        "| 2      | 1    | bump                      |",
        "| 3      | 8    | count (little-endian u64) |",
        "```"
      ],
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "bump",
          "type": "u8",
          "docs": [
            "The PDA bump seed, stored on-chain so we don't need to re-derive it."
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "count",
          "type": "u64",
          "docs": [
            "The current counter value. The `PinaPod` view stores it using its",
            "alignment-one, little-endian representation."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
